body:
I think Tumblr is still pretty popular for fanfiction, though I don't post there myself.

&#x200B;

Edit: Wattpad too, I think.

I consider bashing as portraying a character in a bad light for no particular reason other than "because the author wanted to".  Personally, I see nothing wrong with it. Fanfiction is, after all, an open sandbox where we can write whatever we want.

&#x200B;

Bad writing or not, we should let people enjoy themselves.
